{"a":[65,65],"h":"<p>Binaenaleyh Peygambere itaat Allahın emrine itaat, ona ısyan Allaha ısyandır. 65.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"52\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 51.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 28.4\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"21.7 28.4 35.3\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> hayır<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"73\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 72.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 33.0 33.0 33.0 39.7 48.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 39.7 48.0 56.3\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ya Muhammed, rabbına kasem olsun ki o kendilerini mü'min zu'medenler<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"92\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 92.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 27.0 35.3 35.3 42.0 42.0 48.7 48.7 48.7 57.0 57.0 63.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 68.3 75.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> mü'min olmazlar<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"248\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 248.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 25.6 25.6 33.8 40.6 40.6 47.3 63.0 70.6 83.3 94.6 101.3 110.3 117.0 117.0 132.8 144.0 152.3 152.3 161.3 161.3 161.3 173.3 186.0 186.0 201.8 213.0 213.0 213.0 219.8\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"33.8 47.3 63.0 70.6 83.3 101.3 132.8 173.3 219.8 231.8\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> tâ ki aralarında çatallanmış, niza'lı iştelerde seni hakem yapıb hukmüne müracaat etsinler <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"330\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 330.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 33.0 33.0 39.7 54.0 69.7 76.4 76.4 85.4 85.4 101.2 108.0 108.0 120.0 127.4 148.4 148.4 157.4 157.4